<div class="card"><img src="./image/PHOTO-2026-10-31-00-51-38%202.jpg"><div class="info"><div class="name">Puma / Asics Mix</div><div class="price">15.000F</div><div class="sizes">37-45</div></div><button class="btn" onclick="window.open('https://wa.me/2250566407588?text=Mix')">Commander</button></div>
</div>
<a class="wa" href="https://wa.me/2250566407588">💬 Commander sur WhatsApp - 05 66 40 75 88</a>
</body>
